  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are inured to high alpine conditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Altitude Affinity<sup>ISWG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) on Acrobatics, Climb, and Survival checks in mountain terrain, regardless of elevation. You apply the same bonus on checks or saving throws made to withstand natural cold climate, wind, and weather effects. If you expend one use of your mythic power, you gain the benefit of endure elements and a +2 circumstance bonus on saves vs. all cold and wind effects for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
